                ],
                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "The same panel as Power options, with the title in the warning colour and an alert icon. Stay on drops the panel and Segno stays on; Retry runs the same steps again with the settings flush in its repairing mode. There is no way to switch off without saving. The 7\" readout keeps the track display (owner, 2026-11-02, #1553): the panel on the main screen already says what happened, and Segno stays on with its loops, so the readout has nothing new to tell the player."
              }
            ],
